--- a/arch/riscv/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/Kconfig
@@ -734,3 +734,15 @@
 	  A test loader that turns the calling process into a protected
 	  program over two anonymous mappings, and a hook that holds a
 	  program reference in t6 across a sleeping page fault. Test only.
+
+config RISCV_CAPSTONE_SPATIAL_ONLY
+	bool "Run on a spatial-only Sublet processor (no lifetime table)"
+	depends on RISCV_CAPSTONE_TRAP
+	default n
+	help
+	  For the +Spatial arm: a processor that checks bounds but keeps no
+	  lifetime records (CSMINT writes none, CDERIVE children carry the
+	  parent's id, CREVOKE has no effect). The kernel then checks a
+	  reference by its tag and bounds only: R is accepted without its
+	  record, and a block operand counts as live at depth 1 with no
+	  descendants. Gives no temporal safety. Measurement only.
